%% Parcours de paiement nominal et branche de verification.
%% Sources : services/api-payment/app/main.py, services/api-ledger/app/main.py.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Poste client
    participant E as edge (WAF, TLS)
    participant W as web (React)
    participant A as api-auth
    participant P as api-payment
    participant L as api-ledger
    participant D as postgres

    C->>E: HTTPS 443
    E->>W: requete filtree
    W->>A: POST /token
    A-->>W: jeton signe (JWT, JWKS)
    W->>A: POST /face/verify (si politique forte)
    A-->>W: jeton de session
    W->>P: POST /payments
    P->>P: controles de plafond (GET /limits)
    P->>L: POST /transactions
    L->>D: ecriture partie double, une transaction
    L-->>P: transaction inscrite, grand livre equilibre
    P-->>W: 201, recu
    W-->>C: confirmation de paiement
    Note over P,L: chaque appel alimente la telemetrie
    L->>L: GET /integrity (controle d'equilibre)
